    "saylor": [
      {
        "text": "We’re now tracking Bitcoin’s 200-week moving average and its premium to that level on https://t.co/uGbtzwJ4Pu. Since the 200W MA became available, Bitcoin has traded above it 92% of the time. Today, it sits almost exactly on the line. https://t.co/7IHrLcIoLI",
        "url": "https://x.com/saylor/status/2084045087818891762",
        "time": "Sun Aug 02 22:34:03 +0000 2026",
        "likes": 4628,
        "retweets": 426
      },
      {
        "text": "Bitcoin Drive engaged. https://t.co/sFpTPiMdak",
        "url": "https://x.com/saylor/status/2083894636087574837",
        "time": "Sun Aug 02 12:36:12 +0000 2026",
        "likes": 10857,
        "retweets": 1028
      },
      {
        "text": "The public evidence of BIP-110 adoption is concentrated among Knots users and OCEAN/DATUM miners. There is no identified major exchange, custodian, ETF platform, wallet, or payment network enforcing it. More than 99% of Bitcoin’s economic weight has not adopted it.",
        "url": "https://x.com/saylor/status/2083613203863326987",
        "time": "Sat Aug 01 17:57:54 +0000 2026",
        "likes": 500,
        "retweets": 34
      },
      {
        "text": "Less than 1% of Bitcoin’s economic weight has adopted BIP-110. The claim that 16%-18% of nodes equals 16%-18% support confuses software distribution with economic consensus. Bitcoin is not one node, one vote.",
        "url": "https://x.com/saylor/status/2083613201111945636",
        "time": "Sat Aug 01 17:57:53 +0000 2026",
        "likes": 4156,
        "retweets": 355
      },
      {
        "text": "Reachable node counts are a census of software endpoints, not economic actors. A hobbyist node and a node serving millions via an exchange, custodian, wallet, or payment app are not economically equivalent. Every node is sovereign, but nodes are not equal votes over Bitcoin.",
        "url": "https://x.com/saylor/status/2083613202516938852",
        "time": "Sat Aug 01 17:57:53 +0000 2026",
        "likes": 614,
        "retweets": 36
      }
    ],
